        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: T-Dog, Frank Darabont, Stephen King\n- Works: The Walking Dead, The Mist, The Green Mile, The Tommyknockers\n- Roles: series developer, film director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont created the character T-Dog for the TV series The Walking Dead.\n- Frank Darabont is an American-born U.S. film director.\n- Frank Darabont is renowned for adapting Stephen King’s works to the screen, including The Mist and The Green Mile.\n- Stephen King wrote the novel The Tommyknockers, which was adapted into the miniseries The Tommyknockers.",
