        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Darabont, Stephen King, IronE Singleton\n- Works: The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, The Mist, The Tommyknockers, T-Dog\n- Roles: director, writer, series developer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Darabont is known as a director for film adaptations of Stephen King works including The Shawshank Redemption, The Green Mile, and The Mist.\n- The Tommyknockers is a 1993 television miniseries based on Stephen King's novel of the same name.\n- Frank Darabont wrote and directed the film The Mist.\n- Frank Darabont created the character T-Dog for The Walking Dead, and IronE Singleton portrayed T-Dog.",
